&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Inorsa is an AI-first automation platform transforming how mission-critical infrastructure is designed, maintained, and upgraded. We serve telecom, fiber, data centers, and more, automating everything from document ingestion to drawing generation. Our platform helps infrastructure owners build faster, safer, and more cost-effectively.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re a fast-growing, highly technical team solving complex engineering problems. Every member of our team has a direct impact on product quality, customer outcomes, and how infrastructure is delivered now and into the future.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Now&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;As our agentic platform matures and enterprise deployments deepen, we need a technical leader who can close the gap between AI capability and production-grade reliability. We aren&#39;t competing on general intelligence—we&#39;re winning by being the deepest AI platform in the engineering vertical. This role is the tip of that spear.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architect Agentic Workflows&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement multi-actor state machines using LangGraph, including loops, error-recovery paths, and human-in-the-loop checkpoints&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the observability and evaluation strategy using LangSmith: trace agentic paths, version prompts, and run regression tests against gold-standard engineering datasets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build custom evaluators (LLM-as-judge) and use traces to identify exactly where multi-step agentic chains fail in production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Vertical Domain Integration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate directly with structural and telecom domain experts to encode specialized engineering knowledge into agentic tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate 30+ years of practitioner tribal knowledge into reliable, production-grade automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally with engineers, product managers, and field teams to ensure AI outputs meet the accuracy standards required in high-stakes engineering environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set the Technical Standard&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead by example on AI-native development: Cursor, Claude Code, GitHub Copilot, and equivalent tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automate the grunt work of coding to concentrate team energy on architecture and domain logic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review code, mentor engineers, and raise the bar on quality, performance, and maintainability across the AI stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate progress, risks, and architectural tradeoffs clearly with engineering leadership and product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Experience&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of software engineering experience, including meaningful time building and shipping AI/ML systems in production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert-level proficiency in LangGraph: persistent state management, checkpointers, complex graph topologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience with LangSmith or equivalent observability tooling for agentic systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong async Python and experience deploying scalable AI services in cloud environments (AWS or GCP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with unstructured or domain-specific data: technical specs, site reports, GIS data, or similar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the broader stack: TypeScript/Node.js, SQL, cloud infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Mindset&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anti-hype filter: you&#39;d rather ship a simple, working solution that helps an engineer today than an experimental feature that breaks tomorrow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vertical depth orientation: you understand that edge comes from domain mastery, not breadth of capability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intellectually curious and humble: excited to learn why a structural detail fails from a construction veteran, then figure out how to teach an agent to catch it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High ownership: cares about whether the thing works in the field, not just whether it passes a demo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bonus&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in telecom infrastructure, structural engineering workflows, or adjacent technical verticals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record building evaluation frameworks and prompt regression pipelines at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting a company through Series A or early hypergrowth phases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical, Dental, and Vision Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Insurance &amp;amp; Disability Coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Spending Account (FSA) &amp;amp; Health Savings Account (HSA)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commuter Benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited Vacation Days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid Sick Leave &amp;amp; Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Inorsa&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;At Inorsa, we’re not just building technology — we’re shaping the future of the telecom and structural engineering industries. With our groundbreaking automation tools, we are empowering engineers to transform the way critical telecom infrastructure is built, making it safer, faster, and more efficient than ever before.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in Austin, Texas, and backed by top-tier venture capital, Inorsa is among the fastest-growing and most successful companies in the engineering tech space. We’re revolutionizing how engineers operate, from analyzing complex documents to producing high-quality construction drawings, while providing actionable insights that are changing the game.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we continue to scale, we’re looking for visionary, forward-thinking individuals who are ready to push the boundaries of technology and drive real change. If you’re passionate about solving complex technical problems and making an impact in an industry ripe for disruption, we want to meet you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Inorsa is looking for a Wireless Solutions Architect to drive the adoption and implementation of our cutting-edge AI and automation products in the telecom industry. In this role, you will serve as a trusted technical advisor to our customers, leveraging your expertise in wireless customer workflows to design and deploy impactful solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work alongside a team of hands-on engineers and specialists to build and showcase Inorsa’s capabilities, but you must also be highly technical—understanding how AI and automation can streamline telecom workflows and drive efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bridging real-world use cases with our technology will be key to driving adoption across the telecom markets. With your insights, Inorsa will continue shaping the future of product development while staying at the forefront of innovation in the industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary technical advisor for multiple clients, guiding them through the adoption of Inorsa’s AI-powered telecom solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead customers on a transformational journey, helping them integrate Inorsa into their workflows to streamline engineering and increase efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and execute technical strategies tailored to each account, ensuring alignment with customer goals and industry best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a network of technical champions within client organizations to drive broader adoption of Inorsa’s solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a subject matter expert in wireless for the Inorsa engineering team, providing guidance on best practices, industry trends, and product development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide structured mentorship to team members, fostering a culture of technical excellence and knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in a technical, client-facing role within the wireless telecom industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive expertise in wireless telecom drafting using CAD software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of wireless telecom equipment, as well as operator and tower infrastructure workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills, with the ability to organize, analyze, and communicate complex information clearly and effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to form strong working relationships with executives and champions within customer organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication skills, both verbal and written, with the ability to translate customer needs into actionable feedback for the Inorsa product and engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for market disruption and a desire to build something transformative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in computer science or experience with cloud-based technologies and APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in software onboarding or customer account management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical, Dental, and Vision Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Insurance &amp;amp; Disability Coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Spending Account (FSA) &amp;amp; Health Savings Account (HSA)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commuter Benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited Vacation Days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid Sick Leave &amp;amp; Parental Leave&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Inorsa&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Inorsa, we’re not just building technology — we’re shaping the future of the telecom and structural engineering industries. With our groundbreaking automation tools, we are empowering engineers to transform the way critical telecom infrastructure is built, making it safer, faster, and more efficient than ever before.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in Austin, Texas, and backed by top-tier venture capital, Inorsa is among the fastest-growing and most successful companies in the engineering tech space. We’re revolutionizing how engineers operate, from analyzing complex documents to producing high-quality construction drawings, while providing actionable insights that are changing the game.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inorsa is seeking a detail-oriented and highly responsive individual to join our team as a Drafting QA Specialist. In this role, you will be responsible for performing quality assurance (QA), validation, and static changes to ensure the accuracy and reliability of our deliverables. This role is ideal for someone who thrives in a structured environment and has a strong work ethic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;: Austin, TX (Strong preference for in-office work)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver end-to-end telecom drawings and support internal drafting standards (templates, CAD libraries)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Test AI-generated outputs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collect and share feedback on drawing accuracy and completeness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review files in DWG, PDF, and other viewer formats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience as an AutoCAD drafter, with preference given to telecom industry experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of telecom workflows and drafting standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented with clear, structured communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-driven, comfortable working with direction, high level of self-discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Telecom drafting experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with 3D modeling tools like Revit, SolidWorks, or Inventor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with permitting workflows, GIS tools, and regulatory code compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical, Dental, and Vision Insurance, Life Insurance &amp;amp; Disability Coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Spending Account (FSA) &amp;amp; Health Savings Account (HSA)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commuter Benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited Vacation Days, Paid Sick Leave &amp;amp; Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Inorsa&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;At&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;Inorsa&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;we’re&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;not just building technology —&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;we’re&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;shaping the future of the telecom and structural engineering industries. With our groundbreaking automation tools, we are empowering engineers to transform the way critical telecom infrastructure is built, making it safer, faster, and more efficient than ever before.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:299,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:299}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Headquartered in Austin, Texas, and backed by top-tier venture capital,&amp;nbsp;Inorsa&amp;nbsp;is among the fastest-growing and most successful companies in the engineering tech space.&amp;nbsp;We’re&amp;nbsp;revolutionizing how engineers&amp;nbsp;operate, from analyzing complex documents to producing high-quality construction drawings, while&amp;nbsp;providing&amp;nbsp;actionable insights that are changing the game.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;As we continue to scale,&amp;nbsp;we’re&amp;nbsp;looking for visionary, forward-thinking individuals who are ready to push the boundaries of technology and drive real change. If&amp;nbsp;you’re&amp;nbsp;passionate about solving complex technical problems and making an impact in an industry ripe for disruption, we want to meet you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Inorsa&amp;nbsp;is&amp;nbsp;seeking a&amp;nbsp;Project Engineer (Customer Success) to serve as the technical backbone of our customer relationships across the telecom infrastructure ecosystem. This is a hybrid role that blends customer success,&amp;nbsp;telecom engineering domain knowledge, and&amp;nbsp;technical&amp;nbsp;expertise&amp;nbsp;in SaaS.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;In this role, you will own post-sale technical success and value realization for customers using&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;Inorsa&amp;nbsp;platform. You will act as a trusted technical advisor to customer engineering teams while also serving as a customer-embedded product partner, ensuring our platform maps directly to real-world telecom workflows such as structural analysis, tower modifications, and infrastructure planning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will work closely with customers, product management, engineering, sales, and leadership to drive adoption, retention, expansion, and&amp;nbsp;product-market&amp;nbsp;fit. This role is ideal for someone who understands telecom infrastructure engineering and wants to apply that&amp;nbsp;expertise&amp;nbsp;in a high-impact SaaS environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 3&quot;&gt;Technical Success&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 3&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;amp; Customer Ownership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:281,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:281}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1080,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Serve as the primary post-sales&amp;nbsp;technical owner for a portfolio of telecom infrastructure customers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1080,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Develop and execute customer success plans aligned to engineering workflows, operational KPIs, and business outcomes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1080,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Act as a trusted advisor to structural engineers, RF engineers, project managers, operations leaders, and executives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1080,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;4&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Lead Executive Business Reviews (EBRs) focused on adoption, engineering efficiency, ROI, and roadmap alignment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
