&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;norsa&amp;nbsp;is looking for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;a Technical&amp;nbsp;Account Manager&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;drive the implementation, adoption, and&amp;nbsp;utilization&amp;nbsp;of our&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge&amp;nbsp;AI and automation products in the telecom industry&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;In this role, you will serve as a trusted technical advisor to our customers,&amp;nbsp;leveraging&amp;nbsp;your telecom&amp;nbsp;expertise&amp;nbsp;in customer workflows to design and deploy impactful solutions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This is a high-impact, hybrid role designed for a growth SaaS company&amp;nbsp;operating&amp;nbsp;in the telecom infrastructure ecosystem.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will own post-sale customer outcomes end-to-end—from technical onboarding and adoption to value realization, renewal, and product feedback—while also acting as a customer-embedded product partner. This role is ideal for someone who thrives at the intersection of domain&amp;nbsp;expertise, SaaS technology, and customer advocacy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You will work alongside a team of hands-on engineers and specialists to build and&amp;nbsp;showcase&amp;nbsp;Inorsa’s&amp;nbsp;capabilities, but you must also be highly technical,&amp;nbsp;understanding how AI and automation can streamline telecom workflows and drive efficiency.&amp;nbsp;Bridging real-world use cases with our technology will be key to driving adoption across the telecom markets. With your insights,&amp;nbsp;Inorsa&amp;nbsp;will continue shaping the future of product development while staying at the forefront of innovation in the industry.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
